    {
      "id": "66db906b-f602-4120-b21d-65e1c1c020ae",
      "text": "C20 explicitly authorizes changing MemoryOS scope from the older browser-only prototype to a native SwiftUI step covering the foundation, navigation, fonts, shared controls, and an iPhone readiness check. | When: November 13, 2026 | Involving: MemoryOS project owner/source C20 | This is a current-scope change and does not retroactively approve older browser screens.",
