    {
      "id": "8822589c-a0c3-41b0-a9f5-3b3ebd1852bc",
      "text": "On November 12, the owner rejected the first layout proposal and all five later reference directions, selecting `designs/references/capture-sidebar-owner-reference-2026-11-07.png` as the app's visual authority. | When: November 12, 2026 | Involving: The project owner | This decision is established by the current `README.md`, `.impeccable.md`, `docs/design/home-style.md`, and source C15 in `docs/reference/source-register.md`.",
