    {
      "id": "552ac6e8-4e79-4389-aa48-efe646ec4b5b",
      "text": "On November 13, 2026, the checked Astryx browser flows reported no console errors, page errors, or external requests. The production build and TypeScript check passed, with the app-owned Astryx theme compiled first, and 14 browser flow groups passed across capture, recording simulation, attachments, navigation/focus, search and empty states, person questions, linked records, source access, birthdays, map/list views, language switching, and reload reset. Astryx's build diagnostic reported 12 passing checks with no warnings or failures, while the source diagnostic reported no failures but retained one unresolved warning group for custom styles and SVG use.",
      "type": "observation",
      "entities": [
        "TypeScript",
        "Astryx",
        "SVG",
        "astryx-prototype",
        "custom styles"
      ],
