      "text": "The initiative owner rejected the November 12, 2026 layouts and requested deep online reference research plus distinct design variants for People, Projects, Birthdays, and BrainMap. | When: November 12, 2026 | Involving: MemoryOS initiative owner | The existing layouts were not accepted as the basis for the design exploration.",
