    {
      "id": "e5f09fd6-f94f-44cc-a727-f45986a5179b",
      "text": "As of the verification snapshot in `docs/verification/2026-11-13-swiftui-foundation.md`, VoiceOver focus order, Reduce Motion behavior, physical-iPhone keyboard and safe-area behavior, and older iOS versions still require dedicated checks. The documented accessibility measures (labels, minimum 44-point controls, Dynamic Type, focus requests, escape action, and reduced-motion handling) do not constitute a full accessibility audit. | When: Friday, November 13, 2026 | The source is an authoritative status snapshot, not proof of complete implementation or verification.",
