    {
      "id": "89993853-bea3-4590-896d-ac342521486b",
      "text": "Decision D24: Create the SwiftUI foundation and check device readiness using the supplied Capture and sidebar screenshots. C20 authorizes native project setup, navigation, fonts, shared controls, and connection checks, superseding D09's no-build boundary for this step only; it does not authorize live recording, AI, imports, production storage, publication, or release. | When: November 13, 2026 | Involving: Project memoryos | This is an authorization for foundation setup and readiness checks, not proof that implementation occurred.",
