    {
      "id": "149131b9-a11d-4907-b541-085572449224",
      "text": "The transcription requirement includes Arabic and English, including mixed Arabic/English speech; English-only models ending in `.en` do not satisfy it. Accuracy is unverified and must be tested on an iPhone 15 Pro Max using Iraqi Arabic, mixed-language speech, names, dates, quiet speech, and background noise. Transcription should remain in the source language; translation is a separate choice. | When: November 7, 2026 | Involving: memoryos project | Language capability alone does not establish acceptable accuracy.",
